==Format==
* '''Group Stage''': September ''18<sup>th</sup>'' - October ''4<sup>th</sup>, 2026''
** Teams are divided into 2 Groups
** Each group plays a Single '''Round-Robin''' format
*** Each Group has 6 teams
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 4 teams}} from each group advance to ''[[MR_Ignite/2026/Stage 2/Americas#Playoffs|Playoffs]]''
* '''Playoffs''': October ''15<sup>th</sup>'' - October ''18<sup>th</sup>, 2026''
** 8 teams play in a Double-Elimination bracket
** All matches ''(excl. Grand Finals)'' are {{Abbr/Bo5}}
** Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo7}}

